    },
    {
      "contract": "Independent failures and v2 fix",
      "finding": "The returned real Coordinator.Recovery is bound to completed before local observations. Both observe and final authenticatedRecoveryObserved publish now live in the post-recovery do/catch, which retains signingMaterials, completedRecovery, and exact observation/persistence error separately. Unknown durable ACK invalidates active coordinator/vault/access and forces same-flock configuration reload."
    },
    {
      "contract": "Checked Keychain",
      "finding": "Existing readCore is shared by legacy and strict loads, only errSecItemNotFound becomes missing. Strict manifest path preserves OSStatus/unexpected result/UTF8/limit/migration failures; no read-failure fallback grants recovery. Legacy readability/migration semantics retained. New fixture definitions distinguish actual scoped Keychain calls from constructed policy-error checks."
    },
